[{"answer":"Thank you for calling the Tourist Line.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/1.mp3"},{"answer":"There are many different ways of getting round the city","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/2.mp3"},{"answer":"and we'd like to suggest some you may not have thought of.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/3.mp3"},{"answer":"How about a city trip by boat?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/4.mp3"},{"answer":"There are four main stopping points - from west to east:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/5.mp3"},{"answer":"stop A: Green Banks,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/6.mp3"},{"answer":"stop B: City Bridge,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/7.mp3"},{"answer":"stop C: Roman Landing","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/8.mp3"},{"answer":"and stop D: Newtown.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/9.mp3"},{"answer":"You can find the main booking office at stop A.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/10.mp3"},{"answer":"The first boat leaves at 8 a.m.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/11.mp3"},{"answer":"and the last one at 6.30 p.m.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/12.mp3"},{"answer":"There are also many attractions you can visit along the river.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/13.mp3"},{"answer":"At Stop A, if you have time,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/14.mp3"},{"answer":"you can visit the fine 16th century palace here","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/15.mp3"},{"answer":"built for the king with its beautiful formal gardens.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/16.mp3"},{"answer":"It's very near the booking office.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, you can enjoy every corner of this superb residence.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Stop B - Why don't you visit Tower Restaurant with its wide range of refreshments?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/19.mp3"},{"answer":"This is a place where you can sit and enjoy the wonderful views over the old commercial and banking centre of the city.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Stop C is the area where, in the first century AD, invading soldiers crossed the river;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/21.mp3"},{"answer":"this was much shallower than it is now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/22.mp3"},{"answer":"That's why this area is called Roman Landing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/23.mp3"},{"answer":"There's an interactive museum to visit here","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/24.mp3"},{"answer":"with a large shop which has a good range of local history books.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/25.mp3"},{"answer":"At the furthest point of the trip, stop D,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/26.mp3"},{"answer":"the most exciting place to visit is the new Entertainment Complex","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/27.mp3"},{"answer":"with seven-screen cinema, bowling alley and video games arcade.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Besides the boat tours, there are city buses.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Two companies offer special services:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/30.mp3"},{"answer":"The Top Bus Company runs all its tours with a live commentary in English.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Tours leave from 8.30 a.m. every 20 minutes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/32.mp3"},{"answer":"There are departures from Central Station, Castle Hill and Long Walk.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/33.mp3"},{"answer":"This is a hop-on hop-off service","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/34.mp3"},{"answer":"and tickets are valid for 24 hours.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/35.mp3"},{"answer":"For further details call Top Bus on...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/36.mp3"},{"answer":"02089447810.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/37.mp3"},{"answer":"The Number One Sightseeing Tour is available with a commentary in eight languages.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Buses depart from Central Station every five to six minutes from about 9 a.m.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/39.mp3"},{"answer":"with the last bus at around 7 p.m.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/40.mp3"},{"answer":"There are also Number One services with an English-speaking...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-2-part-2-2023-07-28-17-12-56/41.mp3"}]
